cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, data or these results, please cite them as below."
title: "The Hadwiger–Nelson problem over number fields"
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic tools, data and machine-checked certificates for the
  Hadwiger–Nelson problem on the chromatic number of the plane. Includes a
  short proof that the planes over Q(sqrt2, sqrt3) and Q(sqrt3, sqrt11) are
  4-chromatic (the latter a theorem of K. G. Fischer, 1994), with a
  three-page note, reproductions of chi(R^2) >= 4 and
  >= 5 with DRAT certificates, and multi-distance witnesses for the route to
  chi(R^2) >= 6. AI-assisted research; not peer reviewed.
type: software
authors:
